All six features are implemented and verified. Here's what changed:

**`app/auth.py`** — Implemented `require_api_key`:
- Reads `X-API-Key` header
- Validates against `VALID_API_KEYS` in `database.py`
- Raises `HTTPException(status_code=401)` if missing or invalid
- Returns the mapped username on success

**`app/main.py`** — Added endpoints and updated existing ones:
- **`GET /tasks`** — Added optional query params `status`, `priority`, `assigned_to` (all combinable) and `page`/`page_size` (defaults 1/20). Filters the in-memory list, then slices the requested page.
- **`POST /tasks`** — Requires auth via `Depends(require_api_key)`. Validates `project_id` against `projects` (404 if missing). Auto-generates the next unique integer ID (`max existing + 1`). Returns the created task with status 201.
- **`PUT /tasks/{task_id}`** — Requires auth. Finds task by ID (404 if missing). Applies partial updates from `TaskUpdate` using `exclude_unset=True` so only provided fields change.
- **`DELETE /tasks/{task_id}`** — Requires auth. Finds and removes task by ID (404 if missing). Returns 204 with no body.

All files pass `python -m py_compile` and import cleanly.
